      "name": "Armsel Striker-12",
      "slug": "armsel-striker-12",
      "teaser": "Introduces the Armsel Striker-12 into Tarkov",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1677.png",
      "downloads": 28300,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introduce Armsel Striker into Escape From Tarkov</p>\n<p>A 12 round revolving shotgun in EFT? Unreal (screw you revolver system). I took some creative liberty to get this to <em><strong>work</strong></em>, this thing worked like a single action army revolver which BSG revolver system doesn’t work with. So yeah, uhhh I did stuff.</p>\n<p>Weapon Requested By RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>Weapon can be bought from Mechanic LLV1</p>\n<p>Notable Specification</p>\n<p>-12 round (1 chamber + 11 magazine)</p>\n<p>-Picatinny rail</p>\n<p>-Semi Auto</p>\n<p>-Long ass reload time</p>\n<p>Credit</p>\n<p>Animation - Me</p>\n<p>Model - Unsure (was sent by RaiRai, so they might know where)</p>\n<p>Took me a while to make this cause I had to bounce back and forth from keeping myself afloat in Uni and trying to animate.</p>\n<p>You can support me by leaving a feedback and comments. Optionally, you can also support me financially through <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/choccster\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\"><iframe>\n&lt;div class=\"tab-content\"&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Install the Zip from the Gdrive&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Open the Zip&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. Enjoy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</iframe></div></div></div>",
